From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mosip-vivid <vivid@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:25:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] liveness: native wiring for the mosip-vivid vivid-android
 module

- settings.gradle / app build.gradle: include and depend on :vivid-android
  (copied from mosip-vivid integration-android); io.mosip.vivid jars from
  mavenLocal (group-restricted); keep .tflite/.task uncompressed; pick one
  libtensorflowlite_jni.
- app build.gradle: exclude protobuf-java 3.16.3 (pulled by
  biometrics-util 1.3.0, referenced by neither it nor ARC); it duplicates
  the protobuf-javalite 4.26.1 MediaPipe needs (checkDebugDuplicateClasses).
- Manifest: CAMERA permission, optional front camera feature.
- Pigeon: pigeon/liveness.dart (HostApi + first FlutterApi), Kotlin output
  into the vivid-android module, added to pigeon.sh.
- MainActivity: attach LivenessPigeonApi to the activity lifecycle, the
  Flutter texture registry and messenger; LivenessHostApi.setUp; shutdown
  in onDestroy.
- HostApiModule/ArcLiveness: engine factory, network state, audit into
  Components.LIVENESS, policy from mosip.registration.liveness.* global
  params (LivenessPolicySource).
